#!/bin/sh
# Runs a program on the NVIDIA GPU (PRIME render offload, DEC-041). The desktop
# stays on the integrated GPU; only this program's OpenGL and Vulkan go to the
# NVIDIA GPU, which powers back off when it's done.
#   tekne-prime-run COMMAND [ARGS...]
[ $# -gt 0 ] || { echo "usage: tekne-prime-run COMMAND [ARGS...]" >&2; exit 2; }
export __NV_PRIME_RENDER_OFFLOAD=1
export __GLX_VENDOR_LIBRARY_NAME=nvidia
export __VK_LAYER_NV_optimus=NVIDIA_only
exec "$@"
